{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばそわヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだは、節分でしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季  節  の  分  かれ目○゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くあったかくなってほしいなぁ。\n寒いの苦手だから( > <  )   ←切実"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギュッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう行事のとき、いつも家族を思い出します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校から帰ってくると、\nお家の玄関にイワシの頭が挿してあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ今日は節分だあ 豆まきだあ＾＾！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、ウキウキしながら\n「ただいまー」ってしてたのが、懐かしいです  ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族みんなで、鬼はー外ー！福は内ー！\nって家中を回って豆まきしたのも\n懐かしい(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年 お父さんが鬼のお面をして、\n「うわーこわいぞー」って、私とお兄ちゃんと妹を驚かすの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったなー(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の節分は撮影で忙しかったので、\n次の日に、小さい手巻きを買ってきて\n一人で黙々と食べました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは、どんな節分を過ごしましたかー？  ＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  おなまえ：はや●777● さん\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  白以外に好きな色は？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎   水色が好きです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式のときも、当日は白の振り袖を着たけど、\n前撮りのときは、水色にしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにお知らせです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっとやっと、わたくしめ、のぎ天のサークルに入りましたー！⊂( ˆoˆ )⊃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サークル活動第一回目に、他のお仕事で参加できなかったため、どこにも所属出来てなかったんですが\nついに料理部に入ったよー！嬉しいです！(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、もうすぐバレンタインということでチョコを皆で作りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告白とかも...(///)照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら見てください！\n告白シーンはとばしてください！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、舞台【第二章】學蘭歌劇『帝一の國』－決戦のマイムマイム－に\n樋口日奈ちゃんと、Wキャストで出演させて頂くことが決定しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しい！有難いです( >_< )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速色んなメンバーが「絶対観に行くね！」って言ってきてくれて、\n本当にうれしい限りです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この作品と、あとは\n単純にお芝居がすごく好きなので、\nまたひとつ表現者として成長できたらいいなあ、\nと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原作の美美子ちゃんを壊さないように、\nだけどしっかり、井上小百合の演技を見せれるように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、明日、 23:30〜 NHK BSプレミアム「乃木坂46 SHOW!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださーい(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしい...///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみお誕生日おめでとう！\n素敵な一年になりますように(　ˆᴘˆ　)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんの卒業が発表されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、ものすごく寂しくなるんだろうけど、\n彼女の選んだ道を応援したいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も、今ここで出来ることを\n精一杯頑張らなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、明日は、\n「透明な色」スペシャル個別握手会＠東京ビッグサイト\nですね( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムの握手会ということで、\n好きな曲の衣装や制服を自分で選んで着ます！\n私が何を着るのかお楽しみにー ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーでも私が咄嗟の衣装とか着て握手したら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの機敏にパフォーマンスしてるときとのギャップに、\nびっくりしちゃうよなあ...(  ´^_^` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それも面白いかなー？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日向ぼっこ、好き(　ˆᴘˆ　)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽわぽわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/06/3478727/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}